Review fix (T8, test_review_refresh_uncovered.py): find_uncovered keyed units by qualname.

Qualnames are not unique (a property's getter and setter are both C.x), so the old-unit map kept only the last
hash and an untouched getter was reported 'changed'. Now each qualname maps to the set of its hashes at the base;
a unit is unchanged if its hash is among them.

